      "created_at": "2021-02-17T22:27:39Z",
      "updated_at": "2021-02-17T22:27:39Z",
      "body": "Spoke with a couple of different privacy lawyers on this. The advice we received is to just pass the GPC HTTP header through the system and let bidders deal with it for now. I've also reached out to the IAB to get their take.\r\n\r\nWhen CA writes a law linking CCPA and GPC more formal than a tweet, hopefully the IAB will react quickly and we'll follow their lead.\r\n\r\nSo for now, nothing to do on Prebid.js. I've opened https://github.com/prebid/prebid-server/issues/1712 to track the Prebid Server update. Once the issue of jurisdiction is more clear, we'll update this and PBS may tie the header to US Privacy or perhaps treat it like LMT.",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
